  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the jade light pit she senses an enemy and names Liu Guan Yi when an ancient sword dragon tears the defensive Gu formation. She is nearly two hundred years old yet has the body of a young child, with watery bright eyes and a petite frame people would want to protect. Fang Yuan reads her as rank six wood path while she raises vines and a forest that is an immortal battlefield killer move, atypical for her rank, and hides inside it while he empties the pit’s Gu worms. Liu Chang obtained that wood path battlefield killer move for her defense, and she matches a secret code with him before letting him in, then reports the robbery and her fear of tribe punishment.",
      "chapters": [
        1209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "char_liu_chang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has the body of a young child, watery bright eyes, and a petite frame that looks cute and delicate despite nearly two hundred years of age.",
      "chapters": [
        1209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She arrives with Liu Chang as a rank seven wood path Gu Immortal still wearing that childlike body, and she has just gone from rank six to seven, growing more arrogant with the rise while relying on her brother. She presses Yin Wu Que to join Liu tribe as an external supreme elder, blocks Fairy Black Moon from leaving after Yin Wu Que is injured, and is punched flying by a strength path phantom when the quarrel turns into a fight.",
      "chapters": [
        2170
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-and-temperament",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_yin_wu_que",
        "fac_liu_tribe",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She watches Liu Chang’s public challenge of Fairy Black Moon among Liu tribe elders and other Huang Jin tribe immortals, cheering for him to kill that opponent until bedazzlement and the later beating leave him unconscious, then screams that her brother has been killed and carries him away while threatening Black Moon with other righteous path experts.",
      "chapters": [
        2188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "black-moon-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline"
      ]
    }
  ],
